Actually it IS possible for carrots to rust.  Carrots found on any of the
water levels (madusa, swamp, sometimes castle, some home lvls and a Jublix's
hole) have a large enough metallic content - arising from their growing
in soils with a high metallic salt content, due to irrigation -
that they can be rusted.  But only by a rust monster - water cannot 
damage them (Rumor: Dipping such a carrot in water enough times can remove
the salts and thus rustproof them).

